      "innerText": "What is Xfinity Mobile and how does it work? Xfinity Mobile is a mobile service like Verizon, AT&T, or T-Mobile. Xfinity Mobile runs on the 5G network with the best coverage in the US, plus we have over 20 million secure WiFi hotspots exclusively for members. • With great pricing and deals, Xfinity Mobile allows you to cut your mobile bill in half vs. Verizon, AT&T, and T-Mobile. • Plans include premium features like unlimited talk, text, and data for travel in 215+ destinations. • Xfinity Mobile is exclusively available to Xfinity Internet members. Savings comparison based on 1 line of Xfinity Mobile Select vs 1 line of T-Mobile Essentials, Verizon Unlimited Welcome, and AT&T Extra 2.0 (as of 03/24/26). Taxes & fees extra. How do I get a free mobile line with Xfinity? As a thank you for being a Xfinity Internet member, enjoy one Mobile Select line for free for a full year. Save hundreds while you experience our reliable 5G network with zero commitment. You can bring your own phone, or purchase one of the latest devices at a great price from us. After your first year, Xfinity Mobile lines start at $30 per month with Xfinity Internet. 1 free Mobile Select line: Available for new Xfinity Mobile members only. What mobile plans does Xfinity Mobile offer? Our latest plans are Mobile Select ($30/mo with Xfinity Internet) and Mobile Plus ($45/mo with Xfinity Internet). Both offer unlimited talk, text, and data in the US and in 215+ international destinations. Consider Mobile Plus for additonal premium features like Xfinity Mobile Care Plus device protection, phone upgrades every year with a guaranteed discount, 4K ultra-high-definition streaming, and Xfinity Call Guard spam protection. WiFi PowerBoost: Gig speed WiFi with PowerBoost available via Xfinity hotspots and Xfinity gateways (XB7 or XB8) to Xfinity Mobile members only. Gateway required. How does Xfinity Mobile compare to Verizon, AT&T, and T-Mobile? Xfinity Mobile provides incredible value compared to other mobile carriers. •You can save hundreds every year with our plans vs. Verizon, AT&T, and T-Mobile. •While others charge daily fees for roaming, Xfinity includes unlimited international talk, text, and data for 215+ destinations on both of our latest plans. •With our Mobile Plus plan, you get device protection included at no extra cost for your phone, tablets, and smartwatches. With other carriers, you could pay $7-25/mo per device. Make the switch and save. Savings comparison based upon 2 Mobile Select lines and lowest price for unlimited 5G plans of top 3 carriers. Is the Xfinity Mobile network reliable? Yes. Xfinity Mobile is the nation’s most reliable 5G network. With 5G and our millions of secure WiFi hotspots, you’ll stay connected on the best available speed whether you’re at home or on-the-go. Xfinity Mobile utilizes the most reliable 5G network based on RootMetrics® State of the Mobile Union report, United States, 2H 2025. RootMetrics rankings are not an endorsement of Xfinity Mobile. Can I use my phone internationally with Xfinity Mobile? Yes. Both our of our latest plans, Mobile Select and Mobile Plus, include unlimited talk, text, and data in 215+ destinations. Other carriers charge up to $12 per day for international data passes, but Xfinity includes this as a standard benefit. You don’t need to worry about extra roaming fees or daily passes — your phone will just work from the moment you arrive in covered destinations, potentially saving you hundreds on your next trip. International data speeds reduced after 10 GB usage/month. Does Xfinity Mobile have device protection? Yes. We offer comprehensive device protection. While other carriers charge extra for insurance — as much as $25 per device every month — we include it with our Mobile Plus plan. Xfinity Mobile Care Plus: This premium benefit is included at no extra cost with our Mobile Plus plan. It covers any phones on Mobile Plus and every eligible smartwatch and tablet on your account, featuring $0 screen repairs, tech support, and more. Xfinity Mobile Care: Available as an add-on per device for members on Mobile Select or older plans.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(20, 20, 23)",
