        "What is Xfinity Mobile and how does it work?",
        "How do I get a free mobile line with Xfinity?",
        "What mobile plans does Xfinity Mobile offer?",
        "How does Xfinity Mobile compare to Verizon, AT&T, and T-Mobile?",
        "Is the Xfinity Mobile network reliable?",
        "Can I use my phone internationally with Xfinity Mobile?",
        "Does Xfinity Mobile have device protection?"
      ]
