  "body": [
    "Cut your mobile bill in half. Plus, try free for a year. No commitment.",
    "Only Xfinity includes device protection for life",
    "5G phone on us: Xfinity Internet required. Taxes & fees extra. Upgrade Anytime: Requires Mobile Plus and device payment plan. 60 days between each upgrade. Minimum $200 and maximum $830 device credit per upgrade. Visit xfinity.com/eliteupgrade for eligibility terms, conditions and add’l info."
